{"5140630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Over The Gnome!", "steam_appid": 5140630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5147470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a rock that starts out small and heavy and ends up as an unstoppable boulder crushing gnomes. It won't be easy: <strong>as long as you're not big enough, the gnomes will come for you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/9eaf58ecf8265a24ae7202fe51734ccc.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/9eaf58ecf8265a24ae7202fe51734ccc.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Two gnomes running away from a rolling boulder.\" width=640 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow to crush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start small and vulnerable. Crush smaller gnomes to earn gold, grow, and get faster. Once you outmatch your enemies in size, the tables turn: <strong>now you're the danger</strong>. Make yourself so big that nothing can stop you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt the gnomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of gnomes, each with its own behavior and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/6cb00ae5df7acd0cf0fcd64b0a88cadd.avif?t=1788190195\" alt=\"Different types of designs you&#039;ll encounter in the game, shadowed and with the text &amp;quot;Crush them all!&amp;quot; in front.\" width=640 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 worlds with unique mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/6e6b60e47b52e3e7cec09f687ba9aeac.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/6e6b60e47b52e3e7cec09f687ba9aeac.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span> <strong>Forest </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/6e6b60e47b52e3e7cec09f687ba9aeac.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/6e6b60e47b52e3e7cec09f687ba9aeac.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>: mushrooms that make you hallucinate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/d10e9ee1915bab104e255e4fc6680071.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/d10e9ee1915bab104e255e4fc6680071.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span> <strong>Desert </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/d10e9ee1915bab104e255e4fc6680071.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/d10e9ee1915bab104e255e4fc6680071.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>: sand vortexes that suck you in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/02eb53d7beacf213853b3a3aa558caff.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/02eb53d7beacf213853b3a3aa558caff.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>  <strong>Snow  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/02eb53d7beacf213853b3a3aa558caff.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/02eb53d7beacf213853b3a3aa558caff.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>: snowballs that freeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/c6f64a2d95b0371d2ec8cd4ae006154d.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/c6f64a2d95b0371d2ec8cd4ae006154d.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>  <strong>Cave  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/c6f64a2d95b0371d2ec8cd4ae006154d.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/c6f64a2d95b0371d2ec8cd4ae006154d.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>: darkness, you'll need candles to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/a8ec70f5c5593f1e4902abaa18e7359a.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/a8ec70f5c5593f1e4902abaa18e7359a.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span><strong>Volcano</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/a8ec70f5c5593f1e4902abaa18e7359a.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/a8ec70f5c5593f1e4902abaa18e7359a.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span>: fireballs that shrink you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/4a0c8d5eebdb286f879a58be27fbb8ca.webp?t=1788190195\" alt=\"5 pictures: 1. Mushroom on green field, 2. Sand Vortex, 3. Snow balls, 4. Candle lighting a dark space, 5. Flaming rock falling\" width=640 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your toolkit</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shrink Ray</strong>: when a giant gnome is too big to crush, shrink it with your ray until you can. Upgrade it for more range, more power, and a shorter cooldown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Move</strong>: let go of the controls and your rock will head straight for the nearest crushable gnome on its own. Perfect when you're so strong you just want to watch it wreak havoc, you decide when to take back control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stone Fragments</strong>: small stones that orbit you and crush gnomes for you. Add more fragments to widen your radius of destruction without lifting a finger.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and prestige</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your gold on speed, size, and fragments. Fill your boost bar to become even faster, bigger, and farm more gold. And when you hit a limit, <strong>prestige</strong>: it will reset the run, but in exchange you'll earn <i>Ancient Stones </i>that you can use to unlock <strong>permanent talents</strong> that will make you stronger every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/64f1af34b035047a5a92d3dea0bbbae5.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/64f1af34b035047a5a92d3dea0bbbae5.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Willem Dafoe looking up filled with terror gif, but with a gnome.\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a rock that starts out small and heavy and ends up as an unstoppable boulder crushing gnomes. It won't be easy: <strong>as long as you're not big enough, the gnomes will come for you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/9eaf58ecf8265a24ae7202fe51734ccc.webp?t=1788190195\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140630/extras/9eaf58ecf8265a24ae7202fe51734ccc.poster.avif?t=1788190195\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Two gnomes running away from a rolling boulder.\" width=640 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow to crush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start small and vulnerable. Crush smaller gnomes to earn gold, grow, and get faster. Once you outmatch your enemies in size, the tables turn: <strong>now you're the danger</strong>. Make yourself so big that nothing can stop you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt the gnomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of gnomes, each with its own behavior and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai